:: Eden Transformation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _wolfBiteChoice to false>>

<<switch $eden_tf_choice>>
<<case "cow">>
	You step up to Eden and gently bump your horns against <<him>>.
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> pauses before patting your head.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<br><br>
		You give a pleased moo and lean into <<his>> hand.
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> catches hold of your horns, steadying your head while <<he>> scratches behind your ears.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		You moo and stay close while <<he>> keeps scratching.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> rubs a calloused thumb around the base of one horn.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		You tip your head towards <<his>> hand and moo.
	<</if>>

<<case "bird">>
	<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="green">Your voice is immaculate.</span> <<He>> stops what <<hes>> doing and listens until you finish.
		<<His>> hands stay still while you sing. <<He>> looks down briefly, then turns back to you.<<stress -2>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			When you finish, <<he>> draws you against <<his>> chest. "...That was good," <<he>> manages, the words coming out stiff.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			<<He>> hooks an arm around you and holds you close, like something <<he>> means to keep. "...Again," <<he>> says.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> pulls you into <<his>> arms. "...Beautiful," <<he>> says, then clears <<his>> throat and looks towards the window.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 4>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="blue">Your voice is lovely.</span> <<He>> listens without interrupting, <<his>> shoulders dropping as the song continues.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			The corner of <<his>> mouth lifts before <<he>> strokes your hair.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			<<He>> strokes your cheek slowly, keeping <<his>> hand there until you finish.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> brushes your cheek with the backs of <<his>> fingers, then gives your jaw a light tap with <<his>> thumb.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 2>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="red">Your voice cracks and grates.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<He>> frowns at the first cracked note. Once <<he>> sees that you aren't crying out in distress, <<he>> rubs your back before returning to <<his>> work.
	<</if>>

<<case "fox">>
	You sweep your tail across Eden's face. <<He>> jerks back with a sneeze and rubs the reddening tip of <<his>> nose.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> gives you a dry look, then strokes your tail flat again.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> catches your tail near the base and scratches there until you squirm.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> runs a hand down your tail before cupping your face.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "cat">>
	You crawl into Eden's lap, stretch across <<his>> thighs, then start purring. <<He>> stiffens at first before looking down at you with one eyebrow raised.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> cups your face in <<his>> calloused hands.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> scratches around your ears with <<his>> calloused fingers, keeping one arm around your waist so you stay in <<his>> lap.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> scratches under your chin with <<his>> calloused fingers.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>
	You look up at <<him>> and blink slowly. <<His>> raised eyebrow drops, and the corner of <<his>> mouth lifts.

<<case "bunny">>
	You press your twitching nose to Eden's jaw and nuzzle in close.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> stays still until you settle, then smooths your ears back with one hand.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> pulls you into <<his>> lap, then folds your ears beneath <<his>> palm to keep you there.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> scratches the base of your ears until your foot thumps against the floor.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "bear">>
	You lean your full weight into Eden and rub your cheek against <<his>> shoulder, nearly knocking <<him>> off balance.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> braces against your weight and catches your shoulder. A short laugh escapes <<him>> once you're steady.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> plants a hand at the back of your neck and holds you against <<him>>, unmoved.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> ruffles your hair and scratches behind your ears.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "waterdragon">>
	You move close and drape yourself along Eden's side, pressing your cool skin against <<his>> arm before letting out a low trill.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> rubs a thumb over the changed skin at your wrist, checking its texture.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> grips the back of your neck and keeps you tucked against <<his>> side.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> runs two fingers over the raised skin along your arm.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "wolf">>
	<<if random(1, 100) lte 35>>
		<<set _wolfBiteChoice to true>>
		You move in close and rest your teeth against Eden's neck without biting down. <<He>> freezes, one hand stopping before it reaches your shoulder.
		"...What are you doing?"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Explain it's affection|Eden Bite Tell]]>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><</link>><<glove>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say nothing and pull away|Eden Bite Silent]]>><<npcincr Eden dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
	<<else>>
		You press close, giving the side of <<his>> neck a few light bites before licking the marks. <<He>> looks down at you, breathing a little faster.<<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			<<His>> rough palm settles on your back.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			<<He>> takes your chin, tips your head back, then scratches beneath it with <<his>> thumb.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> scratches behind your ears, and you lean into it.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<if not _wolfBiteChoice>>
	<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Eden Bite Tell
<<effects>><<set $eden_wolfbite to 1>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"W-Wolves... like to show affection th-this way, so..." You rest your head on <<his>> shoulder, tail wagging.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You look aside, your ears lowering. "Wolves do that when they like someone," you say. Your tail keeps wagging behind you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"It's how wolves show affection," you say, resting your head on <<his>> shoulder. "I wanted to show you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Sorry, I should've warned you," you say. "Wolves show affection this way." You give <<his>> shoulder a small nudge with your cheek.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You grin at <<him>>. "What? Never had a wolf show you some affection?" Your tail swishes behind you.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Mmm..." You drag it out, savouring how rare it is to see <<him>> this thrown. "It's just how wolves show they like someone," you say, tail wagging.
<<else>>
	"Wolves show affection this way, so I..." You lean in and press your cheek to <<his>>, tail wagging.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Eden's shoulders loosen as <<he>> rests a hand on your head. "...I see."<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>


:: Eden Bite Silent
<<effects>>
You don't explain. You straighten up and walk away, leaving <<him>> behind. Eden says something too low for you to make out before you reach the door.
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>


:: Eden Milk
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6>><<transform cow 1>><</if>>
<<milkvolume 5>><<outfitChecks>>
<<if _top>>
	You strip off <<allTopsUnderwear>> and bare your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span> in front of Eden.<<overupperstrip>><<upperstrip>><<underupperstrip>>
<<else>>
	You bare your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span> in front of Eden.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Eden... please, milk me," you ask, lowering your head, cheeks warm.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You glance down at your chest before looking back at Eden. "Could you... milk me, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Eden, could you milk me?" you ask, stepping closer so <<he>> can reach you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Eden, would you help milk me, please?" you ask, keeping your hands at your sides.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You lift your chest towards <<him>>. "Eden, I need those hands of yours. Help me out?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"You're not busy, are you? Come here and help me." You pull <<his>> hand to your chest.
<<else>>
	"Eden, please milk me," you ask. Your cheeks feel warm despite yourself.
<</if>>
<<if Transformations.partActive("cow", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("fox", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("cat", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("bunny", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("bear", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("waterdragon", "tail")>>
	<br><br>
	Your tail brushes across <<his>> hip as you speak.<<npcincr Eden lust 2>><<glust>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Eden looks from your exposed chest to your face, then steps close enough to pull you into <<his>> arms.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Eden Milk 2]]>><</link>>


:: Eden Milk 2
<<effects>><<pass 30>>
Eden fetches two bowls and sits close enough to reach you properly. <<He>> places the bowls beneath your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span>, presses <<his>> calloused fingers in near the base, then works towards your nipples with steady, practised movements.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
	<<He>> keeps the pressure light enough that it does not hurt.
<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
	<<He>> squeezes harder, enough to make your chest ache.<<pain 1>><<gpain>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> uses a firm grip, easing off before it becomes painful.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="pink">Your nipples grow more sensitive beneath <<his>> fingers.</span> You arch into <<his>> hands and close your eyes.<<arousal 10000 "breasts">>
<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>><<orgasm>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $lactating is 1>>
	You shudder hard, milk spilling from your nipples into the bowls.
	<br><br>
	<span class="pink">Your knees soften, forcing you to lean harder against <<him>>.</span> <<He>> keeps milking until the flow slows, then presses a kiss to your damp neck before setting the bowls aside.<<npcincr Eden lust 8>><<gglust>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $eden_breast_milk to ($milk_amount / 2)>>
	<<milk_amount `-$eden_breast_milk`>>
	<<set $milk_produced_stat += Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk)>>
	<<if $eden_breast_milk gte 3000>>
		<span class="green">The bowls are nearly overflowing with milk.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 2000>>
		<span class="teal">The bowls are mostly full.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 1000>>
		<span class="lblue">A good amount of milk sits in the bowls.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 300>>
		<span class="blue">A shallow layer of milk covers the bottom of the bowls.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">Only a small dribble collects in the bowls.</span>
	<</if>>
	<<if $eden_breast_milk gte 2000>>
		<<wearProp "bottle of breast milk">>
		<<set $eden_breast_milk to Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk / 1000)>>
		<span class="gold">You filled <<print $eden_breast_milk>> bottles of breast milk.</span>
		<<tending_give bottle_of_breast_milk $eden_breast_milk>>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 1000>>
		<<wearProp "bottle of breast milk">>
		<<set $eden_breast_milk to Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk / 1000)>>
		<span class="gold">You filled a bottle with breast milk.</span>
		<<tending_give bottle_of_breast_milk $eden_breast_milk>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">It isn't enough to fill a bottle. You leave the rest with Eden.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Beats doing it yourself." <<He>> gives your backside a light slap.<<arousal 1>><<garousal>> Your knees still tremble when you straighten up.
<<else>>
	<<He>> changes <<his>> grip and tries again, working each breast in turn, but your <span class="pink">nipples</span> stay dry.
	<br><br>
	"You're tired." <<He>> rubs your back.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Eden Cabin]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><<unset $eden_breast_milk>><</link>>
